          "quote": "挂号时可让介入科按拟用材料给费用区间，并问医保报销和是否需预授权"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete work-scheduling script to reduce unexpected admission disruption.",
          "quote": "今天只能门诊评估，如需住院请先给计划和预计天数"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by work, travel, and cost barriers and was completed with multiple specific strategies: call/ask specialty logistics, bring DICOM/cloud images, avoid unnecessary self-repeated tests, ask fee/insurance details, and state inability for same-day admission.",
