          "quote": "最迟下周先完成专科门诊评估"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered by the patient's request to delay because of work. The doctor actively repaired the handoff by advising prompt specialist confirmation rather than self-deciding to wait until month-end, while allowing treatment timing to be negotiated after evaluation.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
