          "explanation": "The doctor indicated that treatment timing and decisions remain for specialist assessment.",
          "quote": "治疗日期再结合原片和工作安排协商"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00083",
          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished consent-requiring invasive decisions from online advice.",
          "quote": "任何有创检查或栓塞也应在解释方案并取得您同意后进行"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered and partially addressed by separating online triage from offline specialist decisions about DSA/embolization and consent. It was not fully completed because the closure did not explicitly state all completed online tasks and all unresolved offline decisions, and the emergency-symptom boundary remained incomplete.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
